Package: ivue
Title: Interactive 3D Visualization of Data and Graphs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Pawel", "Gajer", email = "pgajer@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A home for reusable three-dimensional plotting utilities for
    numerical data and embedded graphs. Visualization is designed around
    browser-based scenes, independently of domain-specific analysis packages.
